        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Deltana DSH4R4 4\" x 4\" x 1/4\" Radius Single Action Spring Hinge, Zigzag Holes</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Locking Pin plus #10 x 1\" Wood Screws and #10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Utilizes Zigzag Hole Pattern for use with wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension.The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH4R4-specifications.gif?v=1704354691\" width=\"572\" height=\"258\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH4R4 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Spring Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width:4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Zigzag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH4R4.pdf?v=1704262172\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH4R4 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different finishes for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Durable Steel</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 x 1/4 Radius Spring Hinge",
                "description": "Deltana DSH4R4 - 4 x 4 x 1/4 Radius, Spring Hinge, Single Action, Zigzag Hole Pattern, 0.097 thick (gauge). Packaged complete with 1 Single Action Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Box with Wood Screws and Machine Screws. Available in 9 different finishes.",
